          "id": "5fc8891a138f4025cac85ce9",
          "questionNumber": 1,
          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "Which of the following statement(s) is/are true as per the given arrangement?",
          "image": null,
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "label": "1",
              "text": "P sits third to the left of Q.",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "2",
              "label": "2",
              "text": "H sits second to the right of the person who sits in front of S.",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "3",
              "label": "3",
              "text": "K sits in front of the person who sits second to the left of R.",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "4",
              "label": "4",
              "text": "S sits to the immediate left of R.",
              "image": null
            },
            {
              "id": "5",
              "label": "5",
              "text": "None of the above.",
              "image": null
            }
          ],
          "correctOptionId": "4",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>According to the question,</p>\n\n<p>Row 1: H, I, J, K, L</p>\n\n<p>Row 2: P, Q, R, S, T</p>\n\n<p>1) No person sits to the right of L.</p>\n\n<p>2) I sits to the immediate right of K.</p>\n\n<p>3) Number of persons who sit to the right of S is same as number of persons who sit to the left of K.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F17_Antesh_25-11-2020_Swati_D6.png\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 145px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F17_Antesh_25-11-2020_Swati_D7.png\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 163px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F17_Antesh_25-11-2020_Swati_D8.png\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 163px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>4) S does not sit in the middle of the row. Here case 2 will be eliminated.</p>\n\n<p>5) Number of persons who sit between K and L is same as number of persons who sit between T and R. From this, case 3 will also get eliminated.</p>\n\n<p>6) T does not sits at any extreme ends.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F17_Antesh_25-11-2020_Swati_D9.png\" style=\"width: 206px; height: 143px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>7) P is not a neighbour of S.</p>\n\n<p>8) J does not sit at any extreme ends.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/12/F17_Antesh_25-11-2020_Swati_D10.png\" style=\"width: 199px; height: 146px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>1) P sits third to the left of Q.&rarr; False</p>\n\n<p>2) H sits second to the right of the person who sits in front of S. &rarr; False</p>\n\n<p>3) K sits in front of the person who sits second to the left&nbsp;of R. &rarr; False</p>\n\n<p>4) S sits to the immediate left of R. &rarr; True</p>\nHence, &lsquo;S sits to the immediate left of R&rsquo; is true.",
          "topic": "Test"
        },
